          "text": "Témoignages: ROBINE-SUR-GALABRE (LA) (04) 18.07.2011",
          "text_sha256": "6361e4690583cca0b71bfdccca0b356bf25758792eac5e94b9884c7e15518879"
        },
        {
          "end_ms": null,
